# Query 2 (2026-10-29): exact existing frozen-evidence allowlist.
# These exceptions do not authorize new raw/private data or arbitrary run outputs.
# Frozen families require protocol/configuration, producer/input hashes and an
# explicit public/private statement. Use an ignored run directory for new output;
# publish only explicitly reviewed files. Scientific logs and negative results
# are evidence, not disposable caches. Never automatically stage local datasets.
!data/raw/
data/raw/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep

